'''Grand Mage Mimon''' (大魔道士ミモーン, ''Daimadōshi Mimōn'', '''Archmage Mimon''') is a [[:Category:Traitless Enemies|Traitless]] variant of [[Dark Priest Mamon]] that appears in the [[Underground Labyrinth/Stage 113|last stage]] of [[Underground Labyrinth]]. She was added in [[Version 12.3 Update|Version 12.3]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Grand Mage Mimon
|image = E 643.png
|appearance = [[Underground Labyrinth]]
|money drop = 3,000¢ - 11,850¢
}}

==Enemy==
This Traitless enemy is very similar to Dark Priest Mamon, with massive health, high damage, great range and far-reaching Omni Strikes, but balanced by her long attack animation. Unfortunately, while she sounds a straightforward enemy, the general nature of the Underground Labyrinth may lock your more useful units out of rotation, unless you save up the proper counters from the beginning.

==Strategy==
:''See [[Underground Labyrinth/Stage 113]]''

