==Trivia==
*[[Dark Priest Mamon|Mamon]] and Mimon have similar names to [[wikipedia:ja:マモー・ミモー|Mamō and Mimō]], a pair of [https://youtu.be/3_b43drGB18 comedy characters] from the variety show ''[[wikipedia:ja:ウッチャンナンチャンのやるならやらねば!|Ucchan Nanchan no Yarunara Yaraneba!]]''. Furthermore, Mimon and Mimō are both redheads.
*She is the first and only enemy to exclusively appear in the [[Underground Labyrinth]].
*The orb she holds in her right hand closely resembles a [[Catseye|Dark Catseye]].

